<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.2">
<l>taṉṉaṭiyār tiṟattakattut tāmaraiyā</l>
<l rend="indent">ḷākiluñci takuraik kumēl</l>
<l>eṉṉaṭiyā ratuceyyār ceytārēl</l>
<l rend="indent">naṉṟuceytā reṉpar pōlum</l>
<l>maṉṉuṭaiya vipīṭaṇaṟkā matiḷilaṅkait</l>
<l rend="indent">ticainōkki malarkaṇ vaitta</l>
<l>eṉṉuṭaiya tiruvaraṅkaṟ kaṉṟiyum</l>
<l rend="indent">maṟṟoruvark kāḷā varē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Even though the Lady of the Lotus speaks of the faults</l>
<l rend="indent">in the conduct of his servants,</l>
<l>it is as if he will say, “My servants would not do that,</l>
<l rend="indent">even if [they] did, they did it for good”.</l>
<l>They serve no other but he of holy Araṅkam, my [Lord],</l>
<l rend="indent">where [he has] placed his blossom eyes</l>
<l>looking in the direction of walled Laṅkā</l>
<l rend="indent">for the sake of princely Vibhīṣaṇa.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
